From 82f4ca99e923546266fb6facd7b1a1877482a74d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 11:10:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add unknown tier support, fix brand-check search scroll, tidy
 shelf live-scan copy

- Add "status unknown" tier throughout: admin-scan.html dropdown/labels,
  generate-brand-pages.js TIER_META, and explicit headline branches in
  scan.html and shelf.html so an unknown-tier brand never gets mislabeled
  as "check" tier
- brand-check.html: collapse the key/price-badge legend into a <details>
  so search results sit closer to the search box, and scroll matching
  results into view on search (matching existing category/filter behavior)
- shelf.html: drop "then snap" from the live-scan tip text since live
  scan doesn't require a manual snap
- Fix stale nav.js/style.css cache-busting version in the brand page
  generator and regenerate all brand pages
